<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Source language, and the fallback for any locale not translated below.

    The app is translated into the same languages as Galaxy Companion on the Linux
    side — Spanish, French, German, Italian and Portuguese — because the two
    are halves of one feature and a device that switches between them should not
    change language on the way across.

    The app name is left untranslated on purpose: "Dualboot" is what the
    feature is called on both systems.
-->
